<title>USA: Norfolk submits Conrail-related report.</title>
<headline>Norfolk submits Conrail-related report.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp on Friday said it submitted a Preliminary Environmental Report relating to its proposed acquisition of Conrail Inc.</p>
<p>The report was required by the Surface Transportation Board's Section of Environmental Analysis.</p>
<p>Conrail has rejected Norfolk's offer in favor of a proposal from CSX Corp.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
